1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:10,195
A linking verb, be, seem, look, feel, taste, sound, smell, become, is followed by an adjective: the soup tastes good; I feel bad.

2
00:00:10,195 --> 00:00:15,755
An action verb takes an adverb: she sings nicely; he speaks English well.

3
00:00:15,755 --> 00:00:18,776
Good is the adjective, well is the adverb.

4
00:00:18,776 --> 00:00:24,479
So the food tastes well, she sings very nice and I am feeling very badly are all wrong.

